{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And Moses said to Joshua.</b> He is the grandson of the prince Elishama son of Ammihud, who was the leader of the banner of Ephraim, and Scripture calls him here Joshua by the name that Moses called him in the matter of the spies:" "<b>Choose for us.</b> It is the way of the language to say thus: בחר לך (2 Samuel 24:12), שבו לנו בזה (below, 24:14)." "<b>Men.</b> Known men, men of valor, men of war, like כלם אנשים (Numbers 13:3)." "<b>and go out to battle.</b> Go out from the camp of Israel to do battle with Amalek:" "<b>and I will be standing on the top of the hill.</b> Which is Horeb, and it is Mount Sinai:" "<b>and the staff of Elohim in my hand.</b> With it I will raise my hands to pray:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:21.289827689Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}